{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:22 2026-09-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:22 2026-09-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:22 2026-09-12 HKT</p><p>今(12日)下午近2時，紅磡暢運道新海濱對開海面，一隻觀光船據報入水下沉，擔心有人被困，消防接報到場，派出蛙人落水搜索，最後證實無人被困，亦無人受傷。據了解，涉事船隻在上址停泊了個多月。</p><img alt=\"消防蛙人落水搜索。莫家文攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c641d227b15c0ab2c3a98c3e11649fc3/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_14_32_18_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"觀光船入水下沉。莫家文攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0401966aa9019a327bcb93dd46e03d8d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_14_32_22_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"紅磡新海濱發現有船入水下沉。莫家文攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/23aa5f9f1d916ee92b7c3418687f891b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_14_32_34_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場搜救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9b7d785edf3ef32a6f354e7f86ac899d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_14_32_33_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"觀光船入水下沉，消防到場搜索。莫家文攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1e875865d4829a3fa39c71556037c49b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_14_32_32_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防派出蛙人落水搜索。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/59a2fd716a0e7a6662eb6c854c7eb361/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260912_143230824_03.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防派出蛙人落水搜索。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7c8fef6e0d460898182ec44173f12a49/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260912_143230824_04.jpg\"/><img alt=\"觀光船入水下沉，消防派出蛙人落水搜索。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f1b1fbe002b0b981a7a74dd306ede906/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260912_143230824_05.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T08:39:42.288173+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}